  "name": "multires_density",
  "description": "Multi-resolution power spectral density at 12 kHz: six full-rate Hann bands (8192 ... 256 points), FIFO of 16 frames per band, 1/24-octave columns, each band's mean bin over the column blended in power and divided by the column's noise bandwidth: white noise plus a 52.7 Hz sine, and pink noise.",
